      "text_raw": "One of the first bandgap ref-\nerences is shown in this\nslide.\nThe PTAT current gener-\nator Q1-Q2-R2 provides a\nPTAT voltage across resis-\ntor R1. This voltage is added\nto the V of transistor Q1,\nBE1\ntowards a bandgap refer-\nence voltage indeed.\nAgain, the output imped-\nance is low, because an emit-\nter follower is used to close\nthe feedback loop at the\noutput.",
